<title>JAPAN: NEC - 6mth group results(SEC).</title>
<headline>NEC - 6mth group results(SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.24 trln	 vs	    1.92 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   92.37		vs	  104.71</p>
<p> Pretax		60.95		vs	   49.68</p>
<p> Net		   31.21		vs	   20.24</p>
<p> EPS		   17.82 yen	  vs	   12.24 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - NEC Corp specialises in computers and communications equipment. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
